
# --- Debate code retrieval (docs/design/debate-agent-retrieval.md) ---
# Every KEY=value line the installer does not write itself is kept on reinstall;
# restart the agent after editing (sudo systemctl restart server-guardian-agent).
# Read-only repo_* MCP tools for claude team members with "code_tools": "mcp":
#GUARDIAN_REPO_MCP=1
# Retrieval limits are unlimited unless set to a positive value. Keep comments on their own
# lines: systemd does not strip a trailing "# ..." from a value.
# Turn retrieval off entirely:
#GUARDIAN_RETRIEVAL=0
# Request steps per agent turn:
#GUARDIAN_RETRIEVAL_STEPS=8
# Requests per step (repo blocks; the rest are deferred to the next step):
#GUARDIAN_RETRIEVAL_REQUESTS=40
# Result bytes per step (the rest are deferred):
#GUARDIAN_RETRIEVAL_STEP_BYTES=163840
# Result bytes per agent turn:
#GUARDIAN_RETRIEVAL_TURN_BYTES=655360
# Compiler-assisted Go index (docs/design/debate-code-index-wiki.md, P2.6). This script installs the
# helper ~/.local/libexec/guardian/goindex; GUARDIAN_GOINDEX_BIN points elsewhere.
# Seconds one extraction may run before it is killed:
#GUARDIAN_GOINDEX_TIMEOUT=180
# Seconds a Go request waits for an extraction in progress before answering by name:
#GUARDIAN_GOINDEX_WAIT=45
# Size (MB) of the Go build cache above which it is cleared after an extraction:
#GUARDIAN_GOINDEX_CACHE_MB=1024
